      "statement": "validateWikiMermaid walks the generated wiki through the backend virtual filesystem (rooted at / for local-wiki and /openwiki for repository) so writes stay inside the docs-only boundary, and leaves files with no failing fences byte-for-byte unchanged (no edit call) to avoid diff noise; only files that actually degrade are rewritten via backend.edit.",
