      "statement": "mermaid and jsdom are optional peer dependencies loaded lazily and memoized; when installed the authoritative parser validates fences, and when absent (ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND/MODULE_NOT_FOUND) validation falls back to a conservative heuristic rather than crashing the run.",
