    {
      "id": "claim_75e20a5309b14f7fb11ae2af46fb4ba5",
      "statement": "The heuristic fallback is deliberately conservative, flagging only near-certain breakages (a reserved end flowchart node id, restricted to flowcharts; a semicolon in a label; an unescaped angle bracket in a label) so a valid diagram is never degraded; it therefore misses errors the real parser catches.",
